roboparty-rp-head (0.2.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.2.0: pure-Python head controller and CLI built on motors_py.
  * Add offline tests and CI (python-tests + amd64/arm64 deb builds).
  * Install roboparty_head to /opt/roboparty/lib/python3/dist-packages and
    expose the roboparty-head launcher.
  * Build against roboparty-motors 2.3 (void set_motor_zero).

